  "details": "I'm glad the see the controls aren't jank, however I think it's an obstruction to the view of things. \n\nSuggested solution: Have a settings toggle to turn off the visibility of the UI. I think most people could look at the simple controls once, and choose to turn it off once they think they can handle it without it's visibility on. Because the mic is PTT only, I don't think a mic indicator is necessary, though if that changes, then a mic indicator might be helpful when it comes to toggling it on or off.",
